      "type": "mission",
      "name": "t:names.mission",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Our Mission Is Simple.",
        "heading_color": "#ffffff",
        "heading_font_size": 64,
        "heading_font_size_mobile": 48,
        "subheading": "<p>To create kitchenware so safe, so durable, and so effortless... you’d never have to think about it again.</p>",
